    "description": "Welcome to Four Square Opononi, a community-focused local supermarket, established in the mid-70s. We offer everyday essentials, fresh produce, alcohol, lotto, ice, NZ Post, and an ATM. In 2013, we had an unfortunate event, and the store burnt down; however, the community rallied around us, and we rebuilt the store. We have a great community that we love to support, and we are proud to sponsor local clubs, events, and schools.",
